="00:18.450" end="00:18.600">But </span><span begin="00:18.600" end="00:18.990">that's </span><span begin="00:18.990" end="00:20.070">ok' </span><span begin="00:20.070" end="00:20.250">'cause </span><span begin="00:20.250" end="00:20.940">so </span><span begin="00:20.940" end="00:21.330">are </span><span begin="00:21.330" end="00:22.110">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.500" end="00:24.150"><span begin="00:22.500" end="00:22.590">We've </span><span begin="00:22.590" end="00:22.920">broke </span><span begin="00:22.920" end="00:23.250">our </span><span begin="00:23.250" end="00:24.150">mirrors</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.330" end="00:26.280"><span begin="00:24.330" end="00:25.350">Sunday </span><span begin="00:25.350" end="00:26.280">morning</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.370" end="00:29.910"><span begin="00:26.370" end="00:26.550">Is </span><span begin="00:26.550" end="00:27.810">everyday </span><span begin="00:27.810" end="00:28.230">for </span><span begin="00:28.230" end="00:28.740">all </span><span begin="00:28.740" end="00:29.040">I </span><span begin="00:29.040" end="00:29.910">care</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.240" end="00:32.100"><span begin="00:30.240" end="00:30.450">And </span><span begin="00:30.450" end="00:30.600">I'm </span><span begin="00:30.600" end="00:30.960">not </span><span begin="00:30.960" end="00:32.100">scared</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.280" end="00:34.140"><span begin="00:32.280" end="00:32.760">Light </span><span begin="00:32.760" end="00:33.120">my </span><span begin="00:33.120" end="00:34.140">candles</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.200" end="00:37.470"><span begin="00:34.200" end="00:34.590">In </span><span begin="00:34.590" end="00:34.890">a </span><span begin="00:34.890" end="00:35.760">daze </span><span begin="00:35.760" end="00:36.060">'cause </span><span begin="00:36.060" end="00:36.360">I've </span><span begin="00:36.360" end="00:36.930">found </span><span begin="00:36.930" end="00:37.470">god</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.450" end="01:03.480"><span begin="01:02.450" end="01:02.597">Yeah </span><span begin="01:02.597" end="01:02.744">（</span><span begin="01:02.744" end="01:02.891">x </span><span begin="01:02.891" end="01:03.038">bunch </span><span begin="01:03.038" end="01:03.185">of </span><span begin="01:03.185" end="01:03.332">times</span><span begin="01:03.332" end="01:03.480">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.480" end="01:05.220"><span begin="01:03.480" end="01:03.930">I'm </span><span begin="01:03.930" end="01:04.350">so </span><span begin="01:04.350" end="01:04.980">lonely </span><span begin="01:04.980" end="01:05.220">and</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.370" end="01:09.000"><span begin="01:05.370" end="01:05.760">That's </span><span begin="01:05.760" end="01:06.930">ok' </span><span begin="01:06.930" end="01:06.990">I </span><span begin="01:06.990" end="01:07.590">shaved </span><span begin="01:07.590" end="01:08.040">my </span><span begin="01:08.040" end="01:09.000">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.120" end="01:10.890"><span begin="01:09.120" end="01:09.390">And </span><span begin="01:09.390" end="01:09.570">I'm </span><span begin="01:09.570" end="01:09.990">not </span><span begin="01:09.990" end="01:10.890">sad</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.250" end="01:12.990"><span begin="01:11.250" end="01:11.730">And </span><span begin="01:11.730" end="01:12.210">just </span><span begin="01:12.210" end="01:12.990">maybe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.110" end="01:16.680"><span begin="01:13.110" end="01:13.440">I'm </span><span begin="01:13.440" end="01:13.830">to </span><span begin="01:13.830" end="01:14.610">blame </span><span begin="01:14.610" end="01:15.000">for </span><span begin="01:15.000" end="01:15.510">all </span><span begin="01:15.510" end="01:15.900">I've </span><span begin="01:15.900" end="01:16.680">heard</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.950" end=